# `instanceof Uint8Array` evaluated inside a separate package. Unlike the class
# route — which resolves the producer's imported vtable singleton — this route
# needs only the consuming module's own `$Uint8Array` intrinsic, so there is no
# cross-package symbol to import. This pins that asymmetry.
# name           dir     deps          root
@test/bytes      bytes   -
main             app     @test/bytes   root
